			"x": -700,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 600,
			"height": 300,
			"text": "### The dream\n\nFree talk with Malphas, plus two choice buttons. **Wake up.** only appears once his patience is worn down (keep refusing him). **Rest.** gives in.\n\nQuoted arrow labels are buttons; `if` after the quote shows it only when true."
		},
		{
			"id": "dream",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 480,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "## dream\nopen\nsay opening\n\nFree talk with [[Malphas]]."
		},
		{
			"id": "yield",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 700,
			"y": -200,
			"width": 480,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "## yield\nscript\naction [[MALPHAS_CLAIM]]\ncue friendly\nsay yield-line\nend [[dream-yielded]]"
		},
		{
			"id": "wake",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 700,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 480,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "## wake\nscript\naction [[MALPHAS_RETREAT]]\ncue irritated\nnarrate wake-line\nend [[dream-resisted]]"
		}
	],
	"edges": [
